      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The North Shore Beach Property Owners Association, founded in 1928, maintains trails, tennis courts, and pavilions for summer gatherings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://shorehambrookhavenneighborhood.org/tracing-the-roots-of-shoreham-a-timeless-community-in-brookhaven/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Shoreham’s LIRR station served commuters from 1900 until its closure in 1938, linking the village to New York City.",
